lla, she meets the protagonist, and by chance, they end up living together for a while. Her speech and behavior are completely different from her appearance, and she is like a young child. The protagonist gradually becomes attracted to her pure-heartedness. But what fate awaited the two of them?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c110591"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7eb3ea56ca80c72a67d3d076b66983dddce0bb8541b3fc06da05ab16ee71c19.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9dfa6f4493b2b4e91e446ea0ae65a08876657aa7eb498f9f1f80c18036428937.webp","width":246,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c141106","characterName":"月城蛍","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c141106"},"originalCharacterName":"月城蛍","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"91"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's classmate from junior high and high school. She’s spent her entire life in this town until she graduated from high school. This summer vacation, she’s returned to the city for the first time in three years and is attending university there. The conversation was a little awkward at first, but as she recalled it, she was reunited with the protagonist. She was truly happy to be reunited with the protagonist. ...There was just one thing she couldn't express in the back of her mind."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c141106"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f3d1beb018b3bbb853efb05659b8c8de7635eeb0ef46640d0b94382da6efa15.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/61dea996b4feaef0f6913826258a1b32f2b6671a6d93b3fcb7f7ea93ca376589.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c141112","characterName":"新条七海","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c141112"},"originalCharacterName":"新条七海","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"71"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"AA"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"37"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who attends a local girls' high school. She met the protagonist when she first enrolled, and their relationship has continued ever since. She loves swimming more than anything and is the captain of the swimming club at school. Her powerful swimming is unimaginable given her small physique, and she is said to be one of the best in the country. There are also rumors that she is attracting attention from all quarters as an Olympic athlete... but she doesn't seem to care much about it, saying it's just a rumor."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c141112"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/85f47000d39d8388186eea13098a313c28ce0be99456bd391e8bdad533f79158.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5df0c678b482f2b8fa454696a31295b2901e20acd219da033479762f13b38c8f.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c141113","characterName":"千夜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c141113"},"originalCharacterName":"千夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Relative Of Sakuma, she is often seen sporting a pika*hu hat and ends up meeting the protagonist one lucky day."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c141113"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b6f18aba24ffa6a606f9a116019cc413578376f603c37ea98bfe12b272764e5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/77d854baaadf155b7bdc7e887e405170579f74c26b1e0416882d6d2081f4131e.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c141114","characterName":"ミツキ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c141114"},"originalCharacterName":"ミツキ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A student at an all girls highschool. She can be timid, but is very kind and caring of the protagonist as well as her older brother."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c141114"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/ima